TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
One agent's runs from its owner's own calls in the last 7 days, newest first.
A run is the agent call plus the model and tool calls made with its run token,
which carry the call's request id as `parent_request_id`. Other callers' runs
are left out. `error` is the agent call's error, or else the latest failed
step's.

NODE endpoint
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        if(parent_request_id = '', request_id, parent_request_id) AS run_id,
        minIf(start_time, parent_request_id = '') AS started_at,
        anyIf(response_status, parent_request_id = '') AS status,
        anyIf(response_time, parent_request_id = '') AS duration_ms,
        anyIf(api_key_name, parent_request_id = '') AS key_name,
        sum(total_price) AS cost,
        countIf(parent_request_id != '' AND startsWith(event_type, 'generate.')) AS model_calls,
        countIf(event_type = 'mcp.call') AS tool_calls,
        countIf(parent_request_id != '' AND response_status >= 400) AS failed_calls,
        substring(
            if(
                anyIf(error_message, parent_request_id = '') NOT IN ('', 'undefined'),
                anyIf(error_message, parent_request_id = ''),
                argMaxIf(error_message, start_time, parent_request_id != '' AND response_status >= 400)
            ),
            1,
            300
        ) AS error
    FROM generation_event_v2
    WHERE user_id = {{String(owner_user_id, required=True)}}
        AND start_time >= now() - interval 7 day
        AND is_final
        AND (parent_request_id != '' OR resolved_model_requested = {{String(model, required=True)}})
    GROUP BY run_id
    HAVING countIf(parent_request_id = '') > 0
    ORDER BY started_at DESC
    LIMIT 50

TYPE endpoint
